UPDATE companies SET description='Faytex Corporation, headquartered in Weymouth, Massachusetts, was founded in 1978 by Bill Fay Sr. Since its inception, the company has focused on delivering quality footwear, apparel, and equipment fabrics backed by customer service and sensible pricing.

