UPDATE companies SET description='Field to Fabric Quilt Company operates as an award-winning specialty quilt shop in downtown Winfield, Kansas. The business provides a full range of quilting supplies and offers longarm machine quilting services to customers throughout the region.

The shop distinguishes itself as the only quilt retailer in Kansas dedicated to DIY t-shirt quilts, assisting makers with project completion using a wide selection of color blenders. Inventory includes fabric by the bolt, notions, books, embroidery floss, and cross-stitch materials, alongside a rotating assortment of pre-cut quilt kits. A classroom space hosts regular sewing events, including monthly hand-work sessions and community shop-hop activities.

The shop participates in the Central Kansas Quilt Shop Hop, the Border Run shop hop with stores in Wellington, Burden, and Ponca City, and the All Kansas/Nebraska Quilt Shop Hop, drawing visitors from across the multi-state region. These events feature exclusive fabrics, block kits, and finishing kits designed by the shop.

