UPDATE companies SET description='Finetex Textile Group operates from Lebanon, Pennsylvania, where it provides full-service textile manufacturing and fabric printing. The company''s leadership includes David Hammond as vice president of manufacturing and Maria Hammond in customer support, alongside Chad Zhang. No founding year or ownership structure is publicly disclosed.

