UPDATE companies SET description='Finnegan Health Services operates from Conway, Arkansas, tracing its roots to 1983 when Finnegan Pharmacy opened in Little Rock. The family-owned business evolved into a dedicated durable medical equipment (DME) provider in 1994, expanding statewide to serve Arkansas Medicaid and Medicare patients.

The company supplies a broad range of home healthcare products — including incontinence, urinary, nutritional, ostomy, wound care, bath safety, walking aids, diabetic testing supplies, tracheostomy and suction equipment, gloves, and safety items — delivered directly to patients’ doors.

Finnegan serves children, elderly, and disabled individuals across Arkansas who require insurance-covered medical essentials. Its customer base includes Medicaid and Medicare beneficiaries, privately insured patients, and healthcare providers who refer patients for coordinated DME support. Testimonials highlight service to families managing type 1 diabetes, wound care, and other chronic conditions.

