UPDATE companies SET description='First Cable Line, Inc. was founded in 1993 in Arcadia, California, where it maintains its headquarters and a stocked facility. The company operates as an electronics manufacturing services (EMS) provider under the leadership of General Manager Michael Lin, with additional production sites in three countries that give it a geographic advantage for global customers.

The company delivers full turnkey manufacturing, ranging from custom cable assemblies and wire harnesses to printed circuit board assembly using surface-mount and through-hole lines, metal stamping, and complete contract manufacturing. Its Arcadia location carries a large inventory of standard data and networking cables, while the offshore facilities extend capacity for higher-volume runs.

First Cable Line serves a broad industrial base that includes telecommunications, military and aerospace, audio and video, automation, cloud data storage, intelligence/surveillance/reconnaissance, consumer electronics, and industrial machinery.

The firm emphasizes a “total quality system” backed by UL, ISO 9001, and QS-9000 certifications, along with RoHS and WEEE compliance. It positions itself as a one-stop shop that can accelerate time to market through rapid quoting, design-for-cost improvements, and on-time delivery.', certifications=ARRAY['UL','ISO 9001','QS-9000','RoHS','WEEE']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom cable assembly", "Wire harness assembly", "PCB assembly (SMT)", "PCB assembly (through-hole/DIP)", "Metal stamping", "Contract manufacturing", "Turnkey manufacturing", "Standard cable inventory and distribution", "Cable overmolding", "Offshore manufacturing coordination"], "industries": ["Telecommunications", "Military and aerospace", "Audio and video", "Automation", "Cloud data storage", "Intelligence, surveillance, and reconnaissance", "Consumer electronics", "Industrial machinery"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["SMT lines", "DIP lines", "Metal stamping equipment"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Global facilities in three countries for geographic advantage", "Full turnkey manufacturing from custom cables to stocked standard cables", "Total quality system with UL, ISO 9001, and QS-9000 certifications", "RoHS and WEEE compliant processes", "Rapid quoting, design-for-cost improvements, and on-time delivery"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1993 -> /about-us", "Headquarters in Arcadia, California -> /about-us, db", "General Manager Michael Lin -> /about-us", "Global facilities in three countries -> /about-us", "Full turnkey manufacturing services -> /about-us, /", "Custom cable assembly and wire harness -> /, /about-us", "PCB assembly with SMT and DIP lines -> /", "Metal stamping capabilities -> /", "Standard cable inventory at Arcadia facility -> /", "Certifications: UL, ISO 9001, QS-9000 -> /about-us", "RoHS and WEEE compliance -> /about-us", "Industries served: telecommunications, military/aerospace, audio/video, automation, cloud data storage, ISR, c