UPDATE companies SET description='Florida Torque Converter Corporation operates from Cape Coral, Florida, at 906 SE 9th Street. The company specializes in remanufacturing torque converters for automotive applications.

The company remanufactures torque converters using a process it calls blueprinting, where each component is inspected, machined, and balanced to exceed original specifications. Technicians keep original parts together throughout the process to maintain matched sets. The facility stocks thousands of converters for immediate shipment and offers custom stall-speed calibration for performance applications. Products cover OEM replacement, diesel performance, high-performance, and Jeep-specific units.

Customers include retail buyers purchasing online, wholesale distributors through a dedicated program, and enthusiasts seeking performance upgrades for diesel, high-performance, and Jeep vehicles.

Florida Torque Converter differentiates itself by its matched-part remanufacturing method, lifetime warranty on all units, and the ability to customize stall speeds to a vehicle''s power curve. The blueprinting process aims to reduce vibration and extend component life beyond factory standards.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Torque converter remanufacturing", "Blueprinting (inspection, machining, balancing to exceed OEM specs)", "Custom stall speed calibration", "OEM replacement torque converters", "Diesel performance torque converters", "High-performance torque converters", "Jeep performance torque converters", "Online sales and shipping", "Distributor program"], "industries": ["Automotive aftermarket", "Diesel performance", "High-performance automotive", "Jeep performance"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Keeps original torque converter parts together during remanufacturing to assure matched components", "Blueprinting process: every specification checked, components machined and balanced to reduce vibration", "Lifetime warranty on all torque converters", "Custom stall speed setting to match vehicle power curve", "Thousands of torque converters in stock for immediate shipment"], "facts_used": ["Company name and location: Cape Coral, FL -> db", "Remanufacturing process with matched parts and blueprinting -> pages[''/'']", "Lifetime warranty offered -> pages[''/'']", "Custom stall speed customization -> pages[''/'']", "Thousands of torque converters in stock -> pages[''/'']", "Distributor program -> pages[''/'']", "Product lines: OEM replacement, diesel performance, high-performance, Jeep performance -> pages[''/'']", "Address: 906 SE 9th Street, Cape Coral, FL 33990 -> pages[''/'']"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "When we remanufacture a torque converter we make it better than it was when it was new.", "founded_year": "", "emp