UPDATE companies SET description='Food Concept Idaho operates from Nampa, Idaho, where Ozzie and Brenda Rodriguez founded the family-owned business to design and build custom concession trailers. Ozzie brings nearly 23 years of trailer design and fabrication experience, while Brenda contributes a background in customer service. The company emerged as food trucks gained popularity in the Treasure Valley.

The shop builds trailers from the ground up — chassis fabrication, welding, plumbing, electrical, cabinetry, and commercial appliance installation — all balanced for safe hauling. Every project starts with a detailed consultation to map workflow, equipment needs, and health-code compliance. The company reports more than 200 completed projects and over 150 custom designs, with a 100% inspection pass rate on new units. Warranties cover the structure for two years and appliances for one year through the manufacturer.

Customers range from independent coffee operators and taco vendors to specialty concepts like a mobile sushi bar converted from a bus. The company also serves clients needing cargo or toy-hauler trailers. Testimonials cite Bright Eyes Coffee, Tacos El Guey, and Basil and Bloom as repeat buyers.

The Rodriguezes attribute their speed and quality to their team, and they highlight a consultative approach that balances efficiency, comfort, and cost. Their differentiation rests on a 100% health-inspection pass rate, U.S.-built construction, and a willingness to tackle complex renovations such as the bus-based sushi bar.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom concession trailer design and manufacturing", "Food truck renovation and repair", "Cargo and toy-hauler trailer manufacturing", "Chassis fabrication and weight balancing", "Welding and metal fabrication", "Plumbing and electrical installation", "Commercial appliance installation", "Cabinetry and interior build-out", "Health-code compliance consulting", "Blueprint development and cost estimation", "Project consultation and workflow planning"], "industries": ["Food service", "Mobile food vending", "Catering", "Coffee shops", "Specialty food trucks", "Cargo transportation", "Recreational toy hauling"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["100% health-inspection pass rate on new trailers", "Two-year structural warranty and one-year appliance warranty", "All trailers built in the U.S.A. from the chassis up", "Custom designs tailored to workflow, weight balance, and code compliance", "In-depth consultation before every quote"], "facts_used": ["Location: Nampa, Idaho -> db", "Founders: Ozzie and Brenda Rodriguez -> /about-us", "Family-owned business -> /about-us", "Ozzie has 23 years trailer design experience -> /about-us", "5-year anniversary celebrated (approx 2013 founding) -> /about-us", "Custom concession trailer design and manufacturing -> /, /about-us", "Build trailers from axles up including chassis, welding, plumbing, electrical, cabinetry -> /about-us", "100% health inspection pass rate on new trailers -> /about-us", "2-year structural warranty, 1-year appliance warranty -> /", "200+ projects completed, 150+ custom d