UPDATE companies SET description='Food Concepts, Inc. (FCI) was founded on July 26, 1991 by Brad Duesler above his garage in Middleton, Wisconsin, with the goal of creating better solutions for foodservice operators. More than three decades later, the company remains headquartered in Middleton, just outside Madison, where its team designs, engineers, manufactures, prints, fulfills, and installs fixtures, graphics, and modular systems for customers across the United States.

FCI operates as a single-source partner, combining product design, manufacturing, large-format printing, CAD engineering, graphic design, fulfillment, logistics, and installation under one roof. Its patented proprietary systems include PanelRak™ modular merchandising, the EZ-Tilt Sneeze Guard™ for roller grills, MTF Cabinetry™ modular tube frame construction, MTF Foodservice Kiosk™ pop-up units, ImageTrak™ graphic rail systems, and a Modular Food Court System™. The company also runs two e-commerce arms: FOODPROS.com for foodservice equipment and supplies, and RollerGrill.com for commercial roller grill programs.

The company serves convenience stores, travel centers, grocery retailers, quick-service restaurants, hospitality venues, K‑12 schools, colleges and universities, healthcare facilities, military installations, stadiums, micromarkets, and tradeshow environments. Reference customers cited include Hunt Brothers Pizza, Southwest Georgia Oil Co., United Fast Food and Beverage, Team Saverino, Rocky Rococo Pizza and Pasta, Par Pacific (nomnom), and Driven Coffee.

FCI was started to solve everyday operational challenges in foodservice. The company emphasizes that innovation is purpose‑driven — creating products that make foodservice easier to operate and more profitable — and that having design, manufacturing, printing, and installation integrated allows projects to move faster with simpler communication.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Strategic consulting", "Design services", "Printing (large-format graphics, labels, menu inserts)", "Custom fabrication (wood, metal, plastic)", "Fulfillment & inventory management", "Installation services (nationwide)", "Product design", "Manufacturing", "CAD & engineering", "Graphic design", "Fulfillment & logistics", "E-commerce solutions"], "industries": ["Convenience stores", "Travel centers", "Grocery retailers", "Quick-service restaurants", "Hospitality", "K-12 Education", "Colleges and Universities", "Healthcare facilities", "Military installations", "Stadiums", "Micromarkets", "Tradeshows"], "materials": ["Wood", "Metal", "Plastic"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["All capabilities under one roof: design, manufacturing, printing, fulfillment, installation", "Patented proprietary systems (PanelRak\u2122, EZ-Tilt Sneeze Guard\u2122, MTF Cabinetry\u2122)", "In-house large-format printing with fast turnaround", "Nationwide installation services with DIY guides available", "E-commerce platforms FOODPROS.com and RollerGrill.com"], "facts_used": ["Founded July 26, 1991 by Brad Duesler above garage -> /about", "Headquartered in Middleton, Wisconsin -> /about", "Designs, engineers, manufactures, prints, fulfills, installs under one roof -> /about", "Patented innovations: PanelRak\u2122, EZ-Tilt Sneeze Guard\u2122, MTF Cabinetry\u2122 -> /about, /", "Industries served list -> /about", "Customer testimonials (Hunt Brothers Pizza, Southwest Georgia Oil, etc.) -> /", "Services: Strategic Consulting, Design, Printing, Cus